<article class="prose mt-10 max-w-2xl space-y-4 text-navy/80">
  <p>ListingPack helps licensed or practicing agents produce listing captions and branded graphics. You are responsible for the accuracy of prices, facts, and photos you upload, and for complying with brokerage and advertising rules in your market.</p>
  <p>Free plans include a monthly pack credit and a small ListingPack credit in the poster corner. Pro removes that credit and the pack cap, and adds one-tap Facebook / WhatsApp / copy share from Listings, when payment succeeds.</p>
  <p>Generated copy and graphics are starting points. Review them before publishing to Facebook, Marketplace, Instagram, or portals.</p>
  <p>Facebook Page auto-publishing and similar channel automations are a later Pro Plus feature and are not included until explicitly enabled for your account.</p>
  <p>The service may change Free limits, Pro pricing, or features with notice on the Plan page.</p>
</article>
